    ee=original['expectedPerformanceEn']+' In addition, the learner supplies their own criteria, assignment rules and classifications. One valid example is a self-defined scheme based on the dominant declared macronutrient mass per 100 g and ionic minerals versus organic nutrient classes. Ties and missing data require a rule. Other chemically justified schemes are equally valid; names, origin or marketing alone are not chemical criteria. Labels do not automatically establish particular molecules, bonds or undeclared vitamins.'
